            <div class="instructor-summary-left">
              <div class="instructor-avatar">
                <img
                  src="https://cdn.imweb.me/upload/S2026022631349774b0b42/35ca3940d90ac.png"
                  alt="강사 프로필"
                  class="instructor-photo-img"
                />
              </div>
              <p class="instructor-master-label">마스터</p>
            </div>
            <div class="instructor-summary-right">
              <span class="toggle-label-txt">자세히 보기</span>
              <svg class="toggle-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
            </div>
          </summary>
          <div class="instructor-detail-body">
            <ul class="instructor-creds-list">
              <li class="cred-row">◆ 남성종합컨설팅 회사, 크라운코드 대표</li>
              <li class="cred-row">◆ 마케팅 회사 대표</li>
              <li class="cred-row">◆ 심리치료 회사 대표</li>
              <li class="cred-row">◆ 심리상담사 1급</li>
              <li class="cred-row">◆ 전 초등학교 영어회화 강사</li>
